   $q$The report has no concluding statement. Which sentence, added after sentence 13, would best conclude it?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Stepwells are definitely the most amazing buildings that anyone has ever made.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"informal-overstatement"},{"text":"Other regions have built large modern dams to store water for farms and cities.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"introduces-new-topic"},{"text":"The revival of Kesara's stepwells shows that a centuries-old design can still help communities store scarce rain for the long dry months.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The stepwell at Ranakot descends about thirty meters through nine separate levels.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"restates-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The revival of Kesara's stepwells shows that a centuries-old design can still help communities store scarce rain for the long dry months.$q$, $q$The correct sentence connects the original purpose in paragraph 1 to the restoration results in paragraph 4 and states the significance. The sentence about Ranakot only repeats sentence 4.$q$, 'draft', 'd0501be2-285f-5383-a0c9-d1b5a53f9181')
