   $q$Which sentence, added at the end of paragraph 1, would best state the focus of the whole report?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Old paintings with yellow varnish are honestly not very nice to look at.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opinion-not-focus"},{"text":"Painting has been an important art form in nearly every culture throughout history.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-broad"},{"text":"Conservators can reverse this darkening by carefully removing old varnish, revealing the colors that artists actually chose.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Odile Marchetti painted many harbor scenes during a long career.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Conservators can reverse this darkening by carefully removing old varnish, revealing the colors that artists actually chose.$q$, $q$The correct sentence links the problem in paragraph 1 to the process and results in paragraphs 2 through 4, so it frames the entire report. The Marchetti sentence names an example from paragraph 3 but cannot introduce the whole topic.$q$, 'draft', 'c50f4846-0f1f-5c8d-8ec2-48ea194da042')
