   $q$What do sentences 8, 9, and 10 contribute to the sequence of events?$q$, $q$[{"text":"They show gradual trial and error, so the clean handoff later feels earned.","is_correct":true},{"text":"They describe the championship race in slow motion to build suspense.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misplaces-climax"},{"text":"They explain the official rules of the exchange zone in a sprint relay.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-narration-with-exposition"},{"text":"They introduce a conflict between the narrator and Coach Ferreira.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misidentifies-conflict"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They show gradual trial and error, so the clean handoff later feels earned.$q$, $q$Too early, then too late, then the right spot is a logical progression that prepares for the smooth handoff in sentence 15. These sentences happen at practice, not during the championship race.$q$, 'draft', 'aa203434-f8ac-5def-8443-f0a04b3b03ff')
