   $q$Which sentence should be removed because it does not help explain why the wagon succeeded?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sentence 11","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-analysis"},{"text":"Sentence 10","is_correct":true},{"text":"Sentence 9","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"Sentence 3","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sentence 10$q$, $q$Sentence 10 describes the wagon's paint and horses, which has nothing to do with Baek's explanation of its success. Sentence 11 is the writer's own explanation of the evidence, so cutting it would remove analysis the draft needs.$q$, 'draft', 'd95e0f64-caa6-5efb-83c0-0c458f6a3d65')
