   $q$Which phrase best fills the blank at the start of sentence 8?$q$, $q$[{"text":"For example","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-relationship"},{"text":"As a result","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"Similarly","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-similarity"},{"text":"At the same time","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$At the same time$q$, $q$Sentence 8 turns from the sensors' success to a problem with them, so "At the same time" signals a balancing point. The false alarms were not caused by finding the cracked bearing, so "As a result" sets up the wrong relationship.$q$, 'draft', '90aee6ac-600b-53b0-917e-2e2927ad6d83')
