   $q$Which sentence should be deleted because it does not support the writer's analysis?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sentence 2","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-needed-context"},{"text":"Sentence 7","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-analysis"},{"text":"Sentence 8","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"avoids-counterclaim"},{"text":"Sentence 10","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sentence 10$q$, $q$The train station and river crossings have nothing to do with why first-time runners finish. Sentence 8 should stay, because raising a possible objection lets the writer answer it.$q$, 'draft', '8fa8f357-fefe-5276-8bda-5e42f95a881d')
